{"id":34606922890,"name":"Run api tests","node_id":"WFR_kwLOA_1uaM8AAAAIDru8ig","head_branch":"DHIS2-20927-sequential-te-export","head_sha":"cac58931d9a736c8ea2559610ea6b9430a528ad3","path":".github/workflows/run-api-tests.yml","run_number":52645,"run_attempt":1,"event":"pull_request","display_title":"perf: run tracked entity export fetches in series DHIS2-20927","status":"completed","conclusion":"cancelled","workflow_id":5591308,"check_suite_id":93747047150,"check_suite_node_id":"CS_kwDOA_1uaM8AAAAV08Jq7g","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/34606922890","html_url":"https://github.com/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/34606922890","pull_requests":[{"id":4506015450,"number":25176,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/pulls/25176","head":{"ref":"DHIS2-20927-sequential-te-export","sha":"3829c607814cfcdd1152614d3fb5810c6a354aea","repo":{"id":66940520,"name":"dhis2-core","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core"}},"base":{"ref":"master","sha":"36edf830ca826ac071de42f4160a1180488eac00","repo":{"id":66940520,"name":"dhis2-core","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core"}}}],"created_at":"2026-09-11T13:53:41Z","updated_at":"2026-09-11T13:56:35Z","run_started_at":"2026-09-11T13:53:41Z","jobs_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/34606922890/jobs","logs_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/34606922890/logs","check_suite_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/check-suites/93747047150","artifacts_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/34606922890/artifacts","cancel_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/34606922890/cancel","rerun_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/34606922890/rerun","head_commit":{"message":"fix: query program stages instead of reading the lazy collection DHIS2-20927\n\nRunning the four tracked entity fetches inline instead of on a thread pool\nexposed a latent bug in TrackerProgramService#getTrackerProgramStagesWithDataReadAccess.\n\nIt resolved a program's stages by reading Program#getProgramStages(), the\ninverse side of a lazy Hibernate association. On the pooled threads there was\nnever an inbound transaction, so @Transactional(readOnly = true) opened a fresh\nsession and the collection was initialised from the database. Run inline, the\nmethod joins the caller's existing session, where a Program that is already in\nthe persistence context is handed back as-is: its stage collection reflects\nwhatever relationships were known when that instance was loaded, which can be\nnone.\n\nAn empty stage list is not harmless. TrackerEventOperationParamsMapper passes it\nto TrackerEventQueryParams#accessibleTrackerProgramStages, and\nJdbcTrackerEventStore#addProgramStageConditions binds an empty list as null and\nstill emits\n\n    ev.programstageid in (:programstageid)\n\n`x in (null)` is never true, so the event query matched no rows and every\nenrollment came back with zero events, silently and with no error.\n\nOn the sync path that is data loss rather than a cosmetic gap:\nTrackerDataSynchronizationService#hasFailedChild walks\nte.getEnrollments() -\u003e enrollment.getEvents() to decide whether a tracked entity\nfully synchronised. With the events missing, a tracked entity whose child event\nhad failed remotely looked fully successful, got stamped with lastSynchronized,\nand would have been skipped on every later sync run.\n\nFetch the stages with ProgramStageService#getProgramStagesByProgram, which\nqueries the owning side, so the result no longer depends on the state of\nwhichever session the caller happens to be in. The four fetches stay sequential\nand ThreadPoolManager stays deleted.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 \u003cnoreply@anthropic.com\u003e","author":{"name":"teleivo","email":"teleivo@users.noreply.github.com"},"id":"cac58931d9a736c8ea2559610ea6b9430a528ad3","tree_id":"ef06ec9d2b962ad872eafc75d84bb73c9ed2157f","timestamp":"2026-09-11T13:53:29Z","committer":{"name":"teleivo","email":"teleivo@users.noreply.github.com"}},"workflow_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/workflows/5591308","repository":{"id":66940520,"node_id":"MDEwOlJlcG9zaXRvcnk2Njk0MDUyMA==","owner":{"login":"dhis2","id":1089987,"node_id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjEwODk5ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1089987?v=4","html_url":"https://github.com/dhis2","gravatar_id":"","type":"Organization","site_admin":false,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/events{/privacy}","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/following{/other_user}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/followers","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/gists{/gist_id}","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/repos","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/subscriptions"},"name":"dhis2-core","full_name":"dhis2/dhis2-core","description":"DHIS 2 Core. Written in Java. Contains the service layer and Web API.","html_url":"https://github.com/dhis2/dhis2-core","fork":false,"private":false,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core","archive_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/{archive_format}{/ref}","assignees_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/assignees{/user}","blobs_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/git/blobs{/sha}","branches_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/branches{/branch}","collaborators_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/collaborators{/collaborator}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/comments{/number}","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis